WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.448
Young Huo Qubing rode a fine horse, leading the Han cavalry galloping across the vast northern steppe, magnificent and imposing.

00:00:08.798 --> 00:00:12.830
Day and night they hurried on, crossing the great desert and pressing north.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:18.772
Having won the battle, the soldiers cheered in celebration, and the steppe was filled with the joy of victory.

00:00:19.122 --> 00:00:23.082
The young general stood on high ground, gazing into the distance, full of confidence.

00:00:23.432 --> 00:00:29.000
Then the army advanced toward the northern mountains, climbing step by step to the high summit.

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:36.262
On the summit, Huo Qubing held a ceremony to Heaven; firelight lit the sky — solemn and sacred.

00:00:36.612 --> 00:00:40.500
The soldiers stood in neat ranks, bowing to heaven and earth in thanks for the victory.

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:46.322
From then on, this hero's story has been handed down through the ages, and people will never forget him.

00:00:46.672 --> 00:00:51.424
The sunset dyed the mountains gold, and the hero's figure looked especially tall.

00:00:51.774 --> 00:00:56.094
When later generations speak of this young general, they are full of admiration.

00:00:56.444 --> 00:01:00.116
His name, and that high mountain, remain in history forever.

